-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §3: the agreement's period, to 2 Tevet
-- 5777 (31.12.2016).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`

§ `3 תקופת ההסכם`

-- The period runs to 31.12.2016, the last day in it (convention
-- dates.end). The clause names no first day: the agreement speaks from its
-- signing (14.8.2011, the preamble), and its sections set their own start
-- where they have one (§5's school years, §15(ב)'s תשע"ב).
@ref akn:art_3
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in the Oz agreement's period` d IF
    d `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2016)

#ASSERT `in the Oz agreement's period` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2016)
#ASSERT NOT `in the Oz agreement's period` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2017)
